Achmage Workbench — rhwp v0.9.0 form of a 0.8.7 engine patch (third_party/hop/patches-0.9.0).
Origin: Ieum 0003 (vendor/ieumoffice/vendor/rhwp-core/patches/0003-footnote-area-below-body-flow.patch, sha256 7fe8cd4eea656efbeae086f226abf6f4a32bef463ac9958dd4af9ddb1cab6a06; original author pblsketch <239486537+pblsketch@users.noreply.github.com>)
Status: ported
Differs from the 0.8.7 form: 0.9.0 builds one FootnoteArea per target column, so each area is lowered by the visible body lines/tables that overlap it horizontally (0.8.7: the first area only, whole width).
Regression test: renderer::layout::tests::ieum_0003_footnote_area_lowered_below_overlapping_body_line (new; the 0.8.7 form brought none)

